---
import SiteLayout from '../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import { imagery, siteContent } from '../data/site';
---
<SiteLayout title="Construction, Carpentry & Renovations Auckland | ANDRO" description={siteContent.construction.description}>
  <section class="construction-hero" aria-labelledby="construction-title"><img class="construction-hero-image" src={siteContent.construction.bannerImage} alt={siteContent.construction.bannerAlt} fetchpriority="high" /><div class="construction-hero-shade"></div><div class="construction-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow inverse">CONSTRUCTION · AUCKLAND</p><h1 id="construction-title">Built with<br />purpose.</h1><p class="lead">{siteContent.construction.description}</p></div></section>
  <section class="page-body section-pad"><div class="two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONSTRUCTION + RENOVATIONS</p><h2>{siteContent.construction.introHeading}</h2></div><div><p class="body-copy">{siteContent.construction.introText}</p><p class="body-copy">Preparation matters because details that are missed early can affect access, sequencing, material choices and the finished result. We aim to discuss those practicalities before work gets underway.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss your project <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="content-block"><p class="eyebrow">RESIDENTIAL CONSTRUCTION</p><h2>{siteContent.construction.residentialHeading}</h2><p class="body-copy construction-copy">{siteContent.construction.residentialText}</p><div class="service-list"><article class="service-item"><span>01</span><h3>General carpentry</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b><p>Careful carpentry for practical changes, repairs and improvements, with attention to how new work connects to the existing building.</p></article><article class="service-item"><span>02</span><h3>Decks and fencing</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b><p>Decking and fence work planned around the site, intended use, material exposure and the details that affect durability and everyday function.</p></article><article class="service-item"><span>03</span><h3>Renovations and alterations</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b><p>Thoughtful improvements to existing spaces, balancing appearance, function and the realities of working with an existing structure.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="page-body section-pad"><div class="two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMERCIAL CONSTRUCTION</p><h2>{siteContent.construction.commercialHeading}</h2></div><div><p class="body-copy">{siteContent.construction.commercialText}</p><p class="body-copy">We discuss the sequence of work, site access and any practical requirements before work begins. When specialist trades are needed, we can coordinate with appropriate providers as part of the agreed scope.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Talk through a commercial brief <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="content-block"><p class="eyebrow">A CONSIDERED PROCESS</p><h2>{siteContent.construction.processHeading}</h2><p class="body-copy construction-copy">{siteContent.construction.processText}</p><div class="editorial-grid"><div class="editorial-image"><img src={imagery.construction.src} alt={imagery.construction.alt} loading="lazy" /></div><div class="editorial-image"><img src={imagery.home.src} alt={imagery.home.alt} loading="lazy" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="cta-section"><div class="cta-row"><h2>Tell us what<br />you’re planning.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.construction-hero{min-height:max(580px,min(720px,calc(100svh - 82px)));position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;padding:clamp(80px,12vw,150px) 10%;color:#fff;background:#77766f}.construction-hero-image,.construction-hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.construction-hero-image{z-index:-2;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 48%}.construction-hero-shade{z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,16,14,.62),rgba(15,16,14,.12) 85%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,16,14,.22),transparent 55%)}.construction-hero-copy{max-width:900px}.construction-hero h1{margin:22px 0 25px;color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(68px,10vw,136px);font-weight:300;line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.085em}.construction-hero .lead{max-width:700px;margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-size:16px;line-height:1.85}.construction-copy{max-width:850px;margin:0 0 32px}.content-block .service-list{margin-top:32px}@media(max-width:680px){.construction-hero{min-height:590px;padding:76px 7%}.construction-hero-image{object-position:58% center}.construction-hero h1{font-size:clamp(62px,14vw,92px)}}
</style>
